            <div xml:id="m-09e93d44-02b4-402a-ade9-708110149d02">
              <lg xml:id="m-85178ce1-e574-4801-8b2f-6c7a698ebe8e">
                <l xml:id="m-c76c4e8d-86a4-4c1a-a121-95277062c6b2" facs="#m-dc76a5ec-aa6b-45ec-8329-dd8aafafd6b6" label="ambiguous">Dixit Dominus. 8. G, G*, C.— Conntebor. 1. D, D,... a", as. 133</l><l xml:id="m-6ca67733-65a2-4f8b-9b0b-7e299770770d" facs="#m-1a399e27-16fc-4376-9cc8-f78392a5a53d" label="lyrics-like">8. De torrénte in via bibet :“proptérea exaltábit eâput.</l><l xml:id="m-f87ca73d-bca1-4bbc-abc2-f71fd236d385" facs="#m-1ed9eff6-59cb-494d-b0bd-d7c1c10c4ce1" label="lyrics-like">9. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sancto.</l><l xml:id="m-3b168318-37ae-4821-a4ed-d08cfd2a76f3" facs="#m-1b2e21a2-c9be-448d-a8d8-c0f7537bc6d3" label="lyrics-like">10. Sicut érat in princípio, et núne, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-ec7c050e-94c4-4b68-92a0-07c2559ddd77" facs="#m-760b889c-2f4f-4e50-b513-50fe89e11230" label="lyrics-like">lórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-79145cef-e3b3-4cb9-84b2-901980875305" facs="#m-dce280b7-fb8f-4992-8c28-c699fbfdbbc7" label="ambiguous">Tone 8. G, G*, c.</l><l xml:id="m-7aede217-051a-457b-ad15-e8634aa2ca0b" facs="#m-0e989138-f838-4ec7-a7f0-fbaca4742509" label="text-like">Mediant of 1 accent</l><l xml:id="m-4fc8b099-f7b3-477c-9058-e65433e0d7e6" facs="#m-1e0782bc-3fa1-4d34-b195-ddec3d646fc1" label="text-like">Endings of i1 accent with z prepara¬</l><l xml:id="m-80d66559-88fb-490f-8246-6e517bf09a45" facs="#m-ee02c88c-1eb5-4f06-a727-f84b076c50a4" label="ambiguous">tory syllables</l><l xml:id="m-038c1192-87df-4a61-bcc7-302388068625" facs="#m-32d8483b-006b-4835-8b02-5130634af197" label="ambiguous">G</l><l xml:id="m-603c9297-7fc1-4aab-bc6b-244456391436" facs="#m-737090f8-f369-4eca-9e39-6c5ab9716f06" label="lyrics-like">1. Di-xit Dóminus Dómino mé¬Sede a déxtris mé¬ is.</l><l xml:id="m-159e3f0f-8b8c-40b4-82eb-1cbe00a66907" facs="#m-8c77ea12-70d5-450d-905b-05b3c31eeab9" label="lyrics-like">or: mé- is. or: a déxtris mé¬ is.</l><l xml:id="m-fdeeb6a9-3b8f-49ba-9cbe-aac44bd1c423" facs="#m-7f77f567-6331-45ce-802a-7b60a3eb357f" label="lyrics-like">2. Donec pónam inimícos túos, “scabéllum pédum tuórum.</l><l xml:id="m-3e19d6aa-0ac6-4c53-bf90-0fc6a6229481" facs="#m-5be7d641-ea13-4868-9122-14a8a8636e45" label="lyrics-like">3. Virgam virtútis túae emíttet Dóminus ex Sion:* domináre in</l><l xml:id="m-0d32a928-ad7c-4b82-a0a4-83d8dc0ab347" facs="#m-b69ddf92-d4da-4b0c-ae93-1d2cd0803986" label="lyrics-like">médio inimicórum tuórum.</l><l xml:id="m-3170654e-ec86-4b87-9827-e76c95e596a9" facs="#m-729e664b-8738-41b3-b932-33a9a949efb2" label="lyrics-like">4. Técum princípium in die virtútis túae in splendóribus sanetó¬</l><l xml:id="m-254252b3-6238-4368-b605-823c50f2a0e1" facs="#m-97d85e6b-6f76-4abb-b714-061bae8929dd" label="lyrics-like">rum:*ex útero ante luciferum génui te.</l><l xml:id="m-72a3bbc3-8afa-4ec4-b2d8-1224241adb9b" facs="#m-d22d3d48-40fa-4f78-aafd-961555d11904" label="lyrics-like">5. Jurávit Dóminus, et non paenitébit éum: “Tu es sacérdos in</l><l xml:id="m-155cf36f-0996-462a-8890-3f99f8aaff91" facs="#m-8c4fd5b5-4c6f-4682-b95f-2f127fbc5a35" label="lyrics-like">aetérnum secúndum órdinem Melechisedech.</l><l xml:id="m-f43a4b02-2e11-4a90-8f89-d9e2c934440c" facs="#m-52db0748-ff00-4ab0-85c7-daefdbd8b886" label="lyrics-like">6. Dóminus a déxtris túis,confrégit in die frae súde réges.</l><l xml:id="m-6712a08b-bb8a-4b7e-aa13-720bcaafe5b4" facs="#m-850dd3d1-a6a2-40a4-9762-70a58442bbda" label="lyrics-like">7. Judicábit in natiónibus, implébit ruinas: “conquassábit cápita in</l><l xml:id="m-17eade71-2d78-4d8e-b7fb-c132e134412a" facs="#m-fe3808f3-f593-4598-975d-ec0bb8b23b3b" label="lyrics-like">terra mustórum.</l><l xml:id="m-12ff39a2-46e6-4e00-bfb9-12929fed1935" facs="#m-e4e736e9-c14c-47dd-87d5-c2cd39cd2110" label="lyrics-like">8. De torrénte in vía bibet:“proptérea exaltábit eáput.</l><l xml:id="m-c0d14880-1ff9-487d-abee-6b16ad92bfe7" facs="#m-37daf431-02d6-44c6-8427-4e60ddb91ac4" label="lyrics-like">9. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sancto.</l><l xml:id="m-994ced7c-5f55-4d72-b612-08d65b63e046" facs="#m-9cb12bd8-4817-4736-a924-bf4dfbca64ea" label="lyrics-like">10. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-0e75d1e9-f664-4b65-807e-ea742123b2aa" facs="#m-c3df87e4-30a8-462d-b417-aafda8b31bfc" label="lyrics-like">tórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-9492e608-aaa2-4578-8692-ca0519c083a5" facs="#m-3504142c-6b71-4330-81e2-ed3f97b14c78" label="ambiguous">Psalm 110. Confitebor.</l><l xml:id="m-f4d79f0b-c622-41dd-9634-3e50cd1b4100" facs="#m-7931e3ce-4059-4f8a-9b0d-c6b638b2bdc0" label="ambiguous">Tone 1. D, D. Dr, f, g, gr, a, a", a..</l><l xml:id="m-ab0ce5b6-d046-4bcc-8680-61f058ac4c49" facs="#m-cbcdbb35-a285-433b-a968-df46ef31cfc1" label="text-like">Endings of I accent with z prepara¬</l><l xml:id="m-2550a71d-4a42-4e57-abda-c95b69b20912" facs="#m-e7a12722-8b4f-478a-8f26-a85910398153" label="text-like">Mediant of z accents.</l><l xml:id="m-b00c8070-1756-46d8-8d66-a9898f30b029" facs="#m-4f871860-9ef9-4e64-8078-e2bc7538f60e" label="text-like">tory syllables. (For the ending Da, an</l><l xml:id="m-80256164-ef36-41cc-8d06-16b882b8897a" facs="#m-0cba5e62-22dd-446d-8983-8ac3d353ce47" label="text-like">extra note is added in anticipation &amp;</l><l xml:id="m-63f6e789-f6f3-4bc7-880a-edfedd199ee2" facs="#m-fedd1bf2-75a9-43da-bccf-7c2448ef6670" label="text-like">the accent in dactylic cadences)</l><l xml:id="m-f7bb0309-4756-4efb-a9aa-0dfb2f28a88d" facs="#m-cc920003-4768-4f90-8520-445e1d23bac9" label="lyrics-like">1. Confi-tébor tí bi Dómine in tóto cór-de mé¬in consi-li-o</l><l xml:id="m-11646869-ea5d-4173-8302-19eb08a28915" facs="#m-4e406591-bb83-410f-857e-f020cea21d90" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-a54673f4-e936-46ff-b643-645e0f19c7fb" facs="#m-fcb82b64-6b9d-4c18-b7c0-704bd0a98cb2" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-366a7bf2-e32d-486d-a28f-d3bce6a4467f" facs="#m-81bda791-1130-4822-90b5-f6e8f034dc9f" label="lyrics-like">justórum et congrega-ti-ô- ne. or:congrega-ti-ô- ne. or:congre¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
